    "story_slider": {
      "type": "story-slider",
      "blocks": {
        "slide_1": {
          "type": "_story-slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/progress-1.webp",
            "heading": "Where It All Began…",
            "body": "<p>I thought I was doing everything right - eating clean, filtering water, cooking healthy meals for my family. Then gut issues started hitting all of us, and I couldn’t figure out why. The deeper I dug, the more I realized it wasn’t just the food… it was the tools we were cooking on. Plastic</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "slide_2": {
          "type": "_story-slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/progress-2.webp",
            "heading": "The Breaking Point",
            "body": "<p>… “Not long after, I accidentally overheated a non-stick PTFE(Teflon) coated pan before cooking steak and got sick with “Teflon Flu” (Fever, cough, headaches…It wasn’t fun). That’s when I learned it only takes minutes for these non-stick coated pans to reach 500ºF and start releasing toxic chemicals into the air…</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "slide_3": {
          "type": "_story-slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/progress-3.webp",
            "heading": "The Discovery",
            "body": "<p>So I started digging into every so-called “safe” kitchenware option out there. But every single choice came with hidden flaws that forced you to compromise - either on convenience, durability, or worst of all, your health. I wasn’t willing to settle for the lesser evil. I wanted something that was truly safe, something that would last forever.After months of research, I stumbled on titanium - the same pure metal surgeons put inside the human body. . It seemed perfect. Why couldn’t I find titanium kitchenware… the reason is simple: PURE titanium is expensive, nearly impossible to work with, and no factory wanted to try</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "slide_4": {
          "type": "_story-slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/progress-4.webp",
            "heading": "The Breakthrough",
            "body": "<p>So we built our own path. Together with my co-founders, we raised over $11 million in investment capital dedicated purely to research and development. We partnered with engineers, metallurgists, and material scientists - people who knew exactly how difficult pure titanium is to work with and set out to do what every factory told us was “impossible. It took 5 years of trial, error, and relentless iteration to finally create a perfected pure titanium cutting board prototype we were confident to share with the world. It wasn’t easy. The costs were enormous, the setbacks constant. But someone had to prove that kitchenware could be built the right way, not cheap, not toxic, but engineered to last for generations.</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "slide_5": {
          "type": "_story-slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/progress-6.webp",
            "heading": "From One Cutting Board To a Movement",
            "body": "<p>We launched with one product: a titanium cutting board. And the response was overwhelming. Doctors called it revolutionary. Families called it a relief. Customers everywhere told us it was the first time they could finally trust what their food touched. From that single breakthrough, we expanded, first into pans, then utensils, then pots. And today, Taima® is trusted in kitchens across 50+ countries, making us one of the fastest-growing cookware brands in the world.</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "slide_1",
        "slide_2",
        "slide_3",
        "slide_4",
        "slide_5"
      ],
